   "kind": "dark",
   "title": "Is this child's development ON TRACK, or a RED FLAG?",
   "lines": [
    "surveillance every visit (Rourke Baby Record) · screen higher-risk children: LookSee (Nipissing) or Ages and Stages Questionnaire (ASQ)",
    "ASQ grey zone → learning activities + monitor · black zone → further assessment · screens never diagnose",
    "correct for prematurity until 24 months · a consistent trajectory over time matters most"
   ]
